        "observed_at": "enrichment_observed_at"
      }
    }
  },
  "privacy_boundary": "Original PDF/text, term postings and private evidence remain in the existing archive. Only a current independently verified public rights record permits public full-text delivery. Public document metadata never contains private storage keys.",
  "identity_boundary": "Candidate-bound manifestations are not confirmed ScholarlyWorks. Existing source, proposal and document IDs remain unchanged; canonical work resolution is explicit and remains governed by the existing registry.",
  "index_boundary": "Lexical postings and catalogue metadata are rebuildable retrieval projections; no scientific meaning or accepted decision is inferred."
}
